am/apps/2200060/0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58/ss_0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760993361","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58/ss_0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58.600x338.jpg?t=1760993361"}],"short_description":"Who the stars dictate we\u2019ll be. Set out on your destined quest in this narrative RPG with turn-based tactics. Issue commands, light Beacons, exercise compassion. Take heed, for your roles shall constrict, and your tale was always meant to be bittersweet.","steam_appid":2200060,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://linktr.ee/starweavegame"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://subscribepage.io/r613hM"}